          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                <b>Framing time</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Booster Brew™</b> is more than just an energy drink—it’s a daily ritual designed to restore your natural rhythm, sharpen your focus, and elevate your performance from the inside out.  \n<br>\n<b><br>⚡ Supports Natural Energy Production:</b> With ingredients like L-Citrulline, Maca Root, and B-Vitamins, Booster Brew helps your body generate clean, sustained energy—without the crash or jitters of synthetic stimulants.<br>  \n<br>🧠 Enhances Mental Clarity &amp; Focus: Adaptogens like Ashwagandha and Lion’s Mane support the brain’s neurotransmitters, helping reduce stress and improve concentration. Whether you're working, training, or relaxing, Booster Brew keeps your mind sharp and balanced.  \n<br><b><br></b>💪 Boosts Physical Performance &amp; Endurance: Beta-Alanine and L-Arginine promote better blood flow and oxygen delivery, helping you push harder during workouts and recover faster afterward.<br>  \n<br>🔥 Supports Male Vitality &amp; Hormonal Balance: Ingredients like Tongkat Ali and Zinc are known to support testosterone levels, stamina, and overall male performance—naturally and safely.  \n<br><br>🌿 Reduces Fatigue &amp; Stress: Booster Brew’s adaptogenic blend helps regulate cortisol, the stress hormone, allowing your body to stay energized and emotionally resilient throughout the day.  \n<br><br>🛡️ Promotes Cellular Health &amp; Detoxification: Antioxidants like Green Tea Extract and Chaga Mushroom help fight oxidative stress, support liver function, and protect your cells from daily wear and tear. Antioxidants like Green Tea Extract and Chaga Mushroom help fight oxidative stress, support liver function, and protect your cells from daily wear and tear.<br>  \n<br>🌱 Clean, Conscious Formulation: No GMOs, no gluten, no artificial additives. Just a clean, plant-powered formula crafted in GMP-certified facilities for purity, safety, and results you can feel.\n<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "ulyqAdLAuz",
